      "title": "Portal Set",
      "handle": "portal-set",
      "body_html": "<div class=\"productView-moreItem moreItem-breadcrumb hidden-on-mobile\">Twelve sacred flames. Full immersion.</div>\n<div class=\"tabs-contents tabs-contents-popup clearfix halo-text-format is-show\">\n<div class=\"tab-content is-active\" id=\"tab-description\">\n<div class=\"toggle-content popup-mobile\" id=\"tab-description-mobile\" data-product-description-9090683207905=\"\">\n<div class=\"tab-popup-content\"></div>\n<div class=\"tab-popup-content\">Every month, receive twelve hand-crafted ceremonial candles from Heka’s wax lab a complete ritual collection, each one infused with intention, symbolism, and devotion. </div>\n<div class=\"tab-popup-content\">The Portal Set is for those who live inside the ritual.<br>Set of 12 candles:<br><br>4 — 6 x 20 cm<br>4 — 6 x 25 cm<br>4 — 6 x 30 cm<br><br>Each set is available in Handpainted Symbols or Natural Heka Wax Seal choose your finish at checkout.<br>Handpainted candles feature our signature sacred symbols. Natural Heka Wax Seal candles are left in their pure form, with the Heka brand seal.<br>Subscribe monthly. Auto-renews. Skip or cancel anytime.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
